  "unresolved": [
    "slider blakk.bb.shadehidseek (SEEK) and hidvol (VOLUME) are hidden w=436 h=0 sliders in the groupdefs; the visible seek/volume bars are the layer rects above, and click-to-seek/volume in the original is driven by scripts/boombox.maki (not parsed) using the seek/volume map images.",
    "button blakk-switch-bton has no action attribute in the XML; in Winamp it cycles boombox/remote/stick modes (scripts/boombox.maki). v1: no mode switch, treated as unassigned.",
    "togglebuttons blakk.bb.toggle-eq/ml/pl all use downImage/activeImage player.bb-toggle-pl-bton-down in the XML (same file for all three); text overlays carry the on/off state images.",
    "Spectrum animation, speaker animation (LeftSpeaker/RightSpeaker layers), X-BASS toggle behaviour and songticker scrolling are driven by scripts/boombox.maki / boombox2.maki, not by the XML; v1 renders the static spectrum-off layer and a simple HTML ticker instead.",
    "Layout sizes for EQ / Playlist / remote / stick modes are in xml/blakk-eq.xml, xml/blakk-remote.xml, xml/blakk-stick.xml and xml/playlist-editor.xml — not parsed for v1 (main window only)."
  ]
